            "url": "https://edge.adobedc.net/ee/va/v1/ping",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Signals a ping event.  Used during main content playback when content must be sent every 10 seconds, regardless of any other API events that have been sent. Send the first ping event 10 seconds after main content playback begins."
        }
      ]
    },
